WEBVTT

NOTE
Transcribed from the narration in this video. Every figure the
speaker states matches the OECD time-use data behind this page.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.180
Hey.

2
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.640
How's it?

3
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.480
You want to know my day?

4
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.720
Pull up a chair,
I've got time for this.

5
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.560
I start with 11 hours and
35 minutes of personal care.

6
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.320
Sleep, meals, getting ready.

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.900
That's 30 minutes more than
the 35 country average.

8
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.680
The morning is mine.

9
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.320
Then I work.

10
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.760
Four hours and 1 minute
of paid work a day,

11
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.700
that's actually 31
minutes below average.

12
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.100
Doesn't sound like much, right?

13
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.400
But here's the thing,
South Africa works

14
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.500
2,181 hours a year, the third
longest work year of the 35.

15
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:42.040
That's 500 hours more than average
and 694 hours more than France.

16
00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:46.100
At home, 3 hours and 2
minutes of unpaid work.

17
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.500
16 minutes below average.

18
00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.220
But in South Africa,
like all other countries,

19
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.020
women do 146 minutes
more per day than men,

20
00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:58.180
that's 4 hours and 10 minutes
against 1 hour and 43 minutes.

21
00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.000
And leisure.

22
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.700
5 hours and 6 minutes,
18 minutes above average.

23
00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:06.220
More than any of the other four.

24
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.140
One of the longest
work years and still

25
00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:10.700
time for friends and
a prayer after hours.

26
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.900
I stop at 63.

27
00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:17.860
That's 2.1 years earlier than average
and 8 years before Haruto and Sofía.

28
00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:20.304
That's my day in South Africa.
